## Execution
Runs: batch
One batch job through the workspace's configured executor (`_config/executor.yaml`, Slurm),
running `scripts/sample_pca.py` in `gars-bio`. Expected wall time: under 5 minutes (6
samples x 200 genes). Expected output size: under 1 MB in total.
